<title>SINGAPORE: Unocal opens Vietnam office.</title>
<headline>Unocal opens Vietnam office.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unocal Vietnam Exploration Ltd, a subsidiary of California-based Unocal Corp, officially opened its office in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the office will oversee the exploration programme on Block B, offshore southwestern Vietnam.</p>
<p>Unocal signed a production sharing contract with state-owned PetroVietnam in May 1996 for petroleum exploration in the 5,300 square kilometres exploration block, where Unocal has a 45 percent stake, Spain's Repsol 30 percent and Moeco Vietnam Petroleum Co Ltd 25 percent. PetroVietnam Exploration and Production Co has an option to acquire a 15 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
